## libghostty-vt

The Android app links a static build of libghostty-vt from Ghostty.

- Project: https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty
- Pinned commit: see `native/pin.env`
- License: MIT (`licenses/ghostty-MIT.txt`)
- Copyright: Mitchell Hashimoto, Ghostty contributors

The full Ghostty GUI is not shipped. Only the virtual-terminal library
is compiled and linked into `libharn_ghostty.so`.

## AndroidX and the Android SDK

The app uses AndroidX libraries and the Android SDK. Those components
use the Apache License 2.0. See the AndroidX source and the Android
SDK licenses on the build machine.

## Zig

Zig is a build-time tool. The script downloads Zig to `native/tools/`
and does not ship Zig in the APK.
